# CODEOWNERS — routes mandatory review to the responsible agent/role.
# Adapted from other-project/.github/CODEOWNERS. This repo is solo and local
# right now (not even pushed anywhere yet), so every path below points at the
# same human — replace @burakgunduz with real handles/teams if this grows
# past one person and one machine. What matters is the *mapping*, which
# mirrors each agent's own mandate in .github/agents/ and .agents/agents/:
# the point is to have it written down before a team exists, not to enforce
# it via GitHub yet.

# Default: every change gets a general review (code-reviewer's mandate).
*                                   @burakgunduz

# Offline boundary and subprocess invocation — security is a hard, mandatory
# gate here (see .github/agents/security.agent.md). Never skipped for schedule.
