music_service/engines/**            @burakgunduz
app/Services/FrameExtractor.cs      @burakgunduz
app/Services/Muxer.cs                @burakgunduz
app/Services/MusicClient.cs          @burakgunduz

# Contracts and data shapes — architect owns these (see architect.agent.md).
# A change here must go through architect, not a silent patch in senior-dev.
# TempScore.Core/Models + Services hold the actual contract/validation code —
# the WinUI app references this library (ProjectReference), it never gets a
# duplicate app/Models/ folder of its own.
TempScore.Core/Models/**            @burakgunduz
TempScore.Core/Services/**          @burakgunduz
notes/TempScore-Implementation-Guide.md @burakgunduz
notes/10hoursPlan.md                @burakgunduz

